sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as EPP (ext-proc)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant ModelPod as Model-Serving Pod<br/>HTTP
    participant Sidecar as pd-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Remote Prefill Worker<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,ModelPod: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Gateway Mode)
        Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer Token (optional)
        Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ext-proc callout<br/>Optional TLS
        EPP->>ModelPod: Scrape metrics<br/>(KV-cache, queue depth, LoRA)
        ModelPod-->>EPP: Runtime metrics
        Note over EPP: Select optimal endpoint:<br/>KV-cache locality, load,<br/>LoRA availability, scoring
        EPP-->>Envoy: Route to selected pod<br/>gRPC response
        Envoy->>ModelPod: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS
        ModelPod-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 235)
        Note over Envoy,Decoder: Flow 2: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (P/D Mode)
        Envoy->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS
        Sidecar->>Prefill: Forward for prefill phase<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Configurable TLS
        Note over Prefill: Execute prefill,<br/>generate KV-cache
        Prefill-->>Sidecar: Prefill complete<br/>(KV-cache metadata)
        Note over Prefill,Decoder: KV-cache transfer<br/>(NIXL v2 / shared-storage /<br/>SGLang / Mooncake)
        Sidecar->>Decoder: Forward for decode phase<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Configurable TLS
        Decoder-->>Sidecar: Streaming tokens
        Sidecar-->>Envoy: Streaming response
    end
